\v 20 “Now go¦85256 and¦85257 stand¦85258 in¦85260 the¦85261 temple¦85262 and keep telling¦85259 the¦85263 people¦85264 all¦85265 the¦85266 teaching about¦85269 \add new\add* life¦85269.”
