\v 28 “We¦85447 officially commanded¦85447 you¦85448 all¦85448 not¦85449 to¦85451 be¦85451 teaching¦85451 in¦85452 this¦85455 \add ≈name¦85454 and¦85456 authority\add*. But see¦85457 here, now you've¦85458 filled¦85458 Yerushalem¦85461 with¦85462 your¦85464 teaching¦85463, and¦85465 what's more, you're¦85466 blaming us¦85469 for the¦85470 death of¦85475 that¦85477 man¦85475.”\x + \xo 5:28: \xt Mat 27:25.\x*
\v 29 But¦85479 Peter¦85481 and¦85482 the¦85483 other missionaries¦85484 answered¦85478, “It's¦85488 better \nd to¦85489\nd* obey \nd God¦85489\nd* than¦85491 people¦85492.
