\v 31 But \nd God¦85515\nd* honoured¦85519 this¦85513 way-maker and¦85517 saviour¦85518 by¦85520 placing him¦85523 in the¦85520 \add ≈place of¦85523 honour\add*, to \add encourage\add* Yisrael¦85528 to \add ≈repent¦85526\add* and¦85529 \add then\add* to \add ≈forgive¦85530\add* \add &their\add* sins¦85531.
