\p
\v 33 When¦85561 the gathered councils heard¦85562 this, they were enraged and wanted¦85566 to¦85568 kill¦85568 them¦85569,
\v 34 but¦85571 a¦85572 certain¦85572 member¦85579 of the Pharisee¦85579 party¦85579 named¦85580 Gamaliel¦85581 stood up¦85570 in¦85574 the¦85575 council¦85577 chamber. He was a¦85582 law¦85582 teacher¦85582 respected¦85583 by¦85584 all¦85584 the¦85585 community, and he¦85587 ordered¦85587 the \add guards\add* to¦85597 take them¦85587 outside¦85590 for a¦85591 while,
\v 35 then¦85600 he¦85598 said¦85598, “Fellow Israelis¦85609, think carefully about what¦85618 you're¦85619 planning to¦85620 do¦85620 with¦85614 these¦85617 men¦85616.
\v 36 A while back, a man¦85642 called Theudas¦85627 became¦85661 prominent, saying¦85628 that he was¦85629 someone¦85630 important. \add Eventually\add* about¦85644 four¦85646 hundred¦85646 others joined¦85637 him, but he was¦85649 killed¦85649 and¦85654 those¦85623 who'd¦85648 followed him¦85658 were¦85659 dispersed¦85659 and¦85660 it all¦85655 came to¦85662 nothing¦85663.
\v 37 A bit later¦85664 on, a Galilean man named Yudas¦85667 became prominent at the time¦85672 of¦85673 the¦85673 census and¦85675 he attracted¦85676 people¦85677 to him¦85682. But he also¦85683 died¦85684, and¦85685 all¦85686 those who'd been¦85690 persuaded¦85690 by¦85691 him¦85691 ended up¦85666 being¦85692 scattered¦85692.
\v 38 \add ≈So¦85693\add* here's my advice¦85719 to¦85699 you¦85699 all¦85699: pull back from¦85701 \add killing\add* these¦85704 men¦85703 and¦85705 allow¦85706 them¦85708 \add to continue\add*, because¦85713 if¦85714 this teaching¦85698 and goings on is¦85715 man-made, it'll be¦85727 overthrown,
\v 39 but¦85729 if¦85728 it's¦85732 from¦85730 \nd God¦85731\nd*, you¦85735 all¦85735 won't¦85733 be¦85735 able¦85735 to¦85736 bring them down¦85736 in case you¦85754 find¦85754 yourselves opposing God.”
\p So¦85756 they¦85755 were¦85755 persuaded¦85755 by¦85757 \add @Gamaliel¦85757\add*,
\v 40 and¦85758 after calling¦85759 in the¦85760 missionaries¦85761 and having¦85762 them beaten¦85762, they¦85763 commanded¦85763 them¦85763 not¦85766 to¦85767 speak¦85767 using the¦85770 \add ≈name¦85771 and authority\add* \nd of¦85773 Yeshua¦85773\nd* and¦85774 then sent¦85775 them¦85775 out.
