\v 7 \nd God's¦85976\nd* message¦85973 continued spreading and¦85978 the¦85980 number¦85981 of¦85982 followers¦85983 in¦85984 Yerushalem¦85985 was¦85979 rapidly increasing, and¦85988 a¦85987 large¦85987 number of¦85990 the¦85990 priests¦85991 became believers.
\s1 Stephen gets arrested after teaching and doing miracles
