\v 18 Paul¦97014 stayed¦97017 on for quite a few days¦97018 after that, then he farewelled the¦97020 believers¦97021 and went to¦97025 Cenchrea¦97038 where he had his hair cut as was the¦97026 custom for¦97042 someone making a¦97044 vow¦97044. Then¦97028 taking Priscilla¦97031 and¦97032 Aquila¦97033 with him, he¦97041 sailed¦97024 towards Syria¦97027.
