\p
\v 24 Meanwhile a¦97151 Jewish man¦97162 named¦97156 Apollos¦97155 (who had been born in \add the city of\add* Alexandria¦97158) arrived¦97164 in Ephesus¦97166. He knew the¦97170 \add Hebrew\add* scriptures¦97171 well
