\v 23 But¦97921 while he was still there, a¦97926 major disturbance¦97926 hit the¦97930 Yeshua followers.
\v 24 A¦97934 silversmith¦97937 named¦97936 Demetrius¦97932 made¦97938 \add little\add* silver¦97941 shrines of¦97943 Artemis¦97943 and this business¦97952 brought¦97945 a tidy profit to¦97947 the¦97947 \add local\add* craftsmen¦97948.
