\v 26 But¦97982 you've¦97983 seen¦97983 yourselves and¦97985 heard¦97986 from others that¦97988 not¦97989 only¦97990 Ephesus¦97993, but¦97994 almost¦97996 our entire¦97997 \add province of\add* Asia¦97999 \add Minor\add* has¦98005 become¦98019 persuaded¦98005 by this¦98002 Paul¦98001 fellow, and \add now\add* the \add #crowds¦98009\add* are saying¦98010 that¦98011 what we make are¦98014 not¦98013 \add real\add* gods¦98015.
\v 27 However it's not¦98021 only¦98022 us¦98028 and our trade¦98030 that is coming¦98035 into¦98033 disrepute¦98034, but¦98036 the¦98038 temple¦98044 of¦98039 the¦98039 great¦98040 goddess¦98041 Artemis¦98043 is considered¦98047 to¦98047 be¦98047 useless. This¦98024 could result in a loss of power for¦98045 the¦98057 great¦98059 \add @Artemis¦98061\add* that all¦98064 of Asia¦98066 \add Minor\add* and¦98067 the¦98068 inhabited¦98069 world¦98069 have been¦98070 worshipping¦98070.”
