\v 17 \add ≈So¦98756\add* while we were at Miletus¦98758, he sent¦98759 a message to¦98760 Ephesus¦98761 for the¦98764 elders¦98765 of¦98766 the¦98766 assembly¦98767 to come to him.
\v 18 When¦98768 they¦98770 arrived¦98770, he¦98777 told¦98777 them¦98780, “You¦98781 all¦98781 know¦98782 that from¦98784 the¦98785 very first¦98785 day¦98786 that¦98789 I¦98790 set¦98790 foot¦98790 in¦98790 Asia¦98793 \add Minor\add* and for the¦98804 entire¦98805 time¦98807 that I was there
